<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal registered unemployed down Apr yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Portugal registered unemployed down Apr yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of unemployed registered at Portuguese job centres fell 4.1 percent year-on-year to 467,417 in April, the Employment Ministry said Thursday.</p>
<p>In March the number of registered unemployed was 472,092.</p>
<p>&quot;Correcting for seasonal factors, the number of registered unemployed in April is about 453,000 individuals, which underlines a trend for falling unemployment since May 1996,&quot; a ministry statement said.</p>
<p>((--Lisbon Newsroom (351-1) 3538254))</p>
</text>
